{% comment %}
  PM Extension Slot — shared wrapper styles for the Option B pattern.

  IMPORTANT (Shopify platform):
  `{% content_for 'block' %}` must be rendered in the SECTION (or theme block)
  Liquid file, not from this snippet. Shopify associates static blocks with the
  parent that contains the content_for tag; community guidance and theme-check
  also discourage capturing / relocating content_for.

  In each eligible section (no local schema blocks), place:

    {%- if section.settings.show_pm_extra -%}
      <div class="pm-extension-slot">
        {% content_for 'block', type: 'pm-group', id: 'pm-extra' %}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  And add schema:
    "blocks": [{ "type": "pm-group" }],
    checkbox show_pm_extra default false,
    optional stylesheet: {% render 'pm-extension-slot' %}  (styles only)

  Empty detection: cannot safely detect “pm-group has no children” from the
  parent section. The checkbox (default off) is the storefront gate so live
  pages stay unchanged until the merchant opts in.
{% endcomment %}

{% stylesheet %}
  .pm-extension-slot {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pm-extension-slot:empty {
    display: none;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
